  "body": "<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:start -->\n## Linux release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>.tar.gz` is the default Linux build. It supports dynamic library plugins and is built against a GLIBC 2.17 baseline.\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the portable Linux build for musl-based or older systems such as OpenWrt. It does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n## FreeBSD release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_freebsd_aarch64_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the FreeBSD arm64 build. It is built without CGO and does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:end -->\n\n## Changelog\n\n- fix(copilot): flatten cross-protocol assistant text and record upstream API logs (f911b453)\n- fix(copilot): flatten native assistant text history (9abeef8c)\n- Merge pull request #7926 from router-for-me/copilot (657ffc19)\n- feat(antigravity): align and minify upstream model requests (b8e3bc66)\n- chore(deps): upgrade moego to v0.1.0-alpha.5 in plugin examples (0027b8cf)\n- fix(auth): honor credential lockouts in credits fallback (8860264b)\n- fix(auth): retry antigravity credits after unauthorized (8e0641c9)\n- fix(antigravity): exclude cached tokens from non-stream Claude input (590284bd)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve signed tool continuations (3a353935)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve user parts beside tool responses (ae88b00c)\n- fix(openai): preserve antigravity tool call continuations (4df055de)\n- fix(antigravity): merge tool response follow-up turns (9ac1cd7d)\n- fix(antigravity): re-clamp Claude thinking budget after output cap (16bcf5a0)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve non-stream filter errors across terminal frames (c2dcf748)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve grounding metadata across stream aggregation (d0da9a9a)\n- fix(antigravity): surface in-band count token errors (4087007c)\n- fix(antigravity): strip unsupported schema keywords (65ba7863)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve stream filter errors across terminal frames (5ddbfbaf)\n- feat(antigravity): route grouped models by requested thinking level (2f86992c)\n- feat(docs): add 10dian-API information to README files in English, Chinese, and Japanese (0d251842)\n- test(thinking): cover max effort and conversion clamping (114ae68b)\n- fix(thinking): correct budget to max level conversion (a308c55b)\n- refactor(devin): use canonical thinking clamping (a516bf3b)\n- fix(thinking): clamp budgets to levels for OpenAI models (f110136a)\n- fix(thinking): normalize antigravity thinking config aliases (84856805)\n- fix(antigravity): propagate responses translation errors (fc118713)\n- fix(util): handle uppercase object schema placeholders (be39c4d5)\n- fix(auth): preserve terminal tos violation state (14cc6ad1)\n- fix(claude): preserve uncited web search text (1b730a1d)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve models for unknown catalogs (bfed6e89)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve parameterless Claude tool calls (bb8be964)\n- fix(antigravity): wait for non-empty Claude finish reason (7e2b6323)\n- fix(interactions): merge multipart antigravity user turns (0e981b9f)\n- fix(antigravity): emit valid empty tool arguments (28a00389)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve signatures on empty function calls (f663935d)\n- fix(gemini): prevent premature Claude stream termination (5ece0cde)\n- fix(translator): preserve Claude max token finish reason (5621004e)\n- fix(gemini): preserve parameterless Claude tool calls (2b7af40e)\n- fix(antigravity): validate compaction summaries (dc2455d9)\n- fix(gemini): default omitted tool arguments to empty object (dd866f6c)\n- fix(thinking): disable invalid Claude budgets (75d03aea)\n- fix(auth): preserve stream bootstrap attempt identity (f5ef0c0f)\n- fix(codex): default missing Claude tool input arguments (d2b7dbbd)\n- fix(auth): preserve parent affinity after fork failure (ee5225e1)\n- fix(antigravity): honor retry hints on capacity errors (ae3d80f7)\n- fix(antigravity): normalize assistant image data URLs (3307446a)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve mixed native tools in chat requests (d3d2817d)\n- fix(gemini): suppress pending filter frames on stream errors (aeed9715)\n- fix(antigravity): isolate connection pools after credential replacement (bffe6e7e)\n- fix(vertex): normalize Imagen predict protocol (e049c336)\n- fix(antigravity): isolate signature cache by credential (85225381)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* fix(copilot): flatten native assistant text history by @hkfires in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/7926\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/compare/v8.1.1...v8.1.2\n",
